{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01TvJaTozHooA8C6JKUyRNmh","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Bugs Domain\n2\t\n3\t**最后更新**: —  **来源 Job**: —\n4\t\n5\t项目已知问题与精确解决方案。由 `rick learning` 和 `rick dream` 自动追加，勿手动覆盖。\n6\t\n7\t## 已知问题与解决方案\n8\t\n9\t（暂无记录）\n10\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01NaD4V4Y6rxo8eZHRs758Ph","session_id":"f37511af-7116-437b-8854-4e59c8ee8455","uuid":"423a4a51-aeae-4a52-b031-e7ed282cb560","timestamp":"2026-07-04T17:37:29.497Z"}
