lue interface{})` - Sets context value\n  - `Build()` - Replaces `{{variable}}` placeholders with values\n  - `BuildAndSave(prefix string)` - Creates temp file with `.md` extension\n  - `SaveToFile(filePath string)` - Saves to specific path\n  - `GetMissingVariables()` - Returns unset variables\n- **Implementation**: Uses `strings.ReplaceAll()` for placeholder replacement\n\n### 9. **Usage of GetDraftDir()**\nFound in `/Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/cmd/human_loop.go` (line 35):\n```go\ndraftDir, err := workspace.GetDraftDir()\n```\n\n### 10. **Usage of SetVariable Pattern**\nExtensively used throughout:\n- **learning.go** (lines 311-342): Sets job_id, loops_context, learning_loop_path, debug_content, task_md_files, act_path_files, task_execution_results, rick_bin_path\n- **human_loop_prompt.go** (lines 37-43, 68, 80, 93, 112): Sets topic, rfc_dir, draft_dir, think/learn/express agent paths\n- **Other commands** (doing, plan, dream, ctrl, easy): Similar patterns of SetVariable usage\n\n### 11. **Key Observations**\n1. `GetDraftDir()` exists in `paths.go`, not `workspace.go`\n2. It's used by human-loop command to create draft directory structure with subdirectories: `draft/concepts`, `draft/human-learning`\n3. PromptBuilder uses fluent interface pattern (returns `*PromptBuilder` for method chaining)\n4. All variable replacement happens via `strings.ReplaceAll()` on `{{key}}` patterns\n5. No \"draft_dir\" or \"GetDraftDir\" usage in non-human-loop code except tests\n6. Tests verify that `{{draft_dir}}` placeholder is properly replaced (no unreplaced placeholders in output)"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f37511af-7116-437b-8854-4e59c8ee8455","uuid":"6c5edb80-abca-4886-a121-fd3a9214269c","timestamp":"2026-07-04T17:37:58.276Z","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Read the following files and return their full content:\n1. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/.rick/domain/architecture.md\n2. /Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/.