{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_vrtx_01QafonmzGiN9J1LZoo6LWdz","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-4-7","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_vrtx_018KeinAKtVzx6vTB6yEunDq","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/sunquan/ai_coding/CODING/rick/internal/prompt/templates/learning.md","old_string":"## 完成要求\n\n`{{rick_bin_path}} tools learning_check {{job_id}}`\n\nlearning_check pass 后才算完成。","new_string":"## 完成要求\n\n`{{rick_bin_path}} tools learning_check {{job_id}}`\n\nlearning_check pass 后才算完成。\n\n---\n\n## Draft 同步（可选）\n\n如果目录 `{{draft_dir}}` 存在，在所有 loop 步骤完成后，将本次 job 产出的关键 domain 事实追加到 `{{draft_dir}}/progress.md`：\n\n```\n## [{{job_id}}] 学习记录\n\n- <本次新增知识点1>\n- <本次新增知识点2>\n...\n```\n\n如目录不存在，则跳过此步骤。"}}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f37511af-7116-437b-8854-4e59c8ee8455","uuid":"a1a5a304-6874-4e8d-9416-790212e08558"}
